Where Lies Hide {2}{W}{W}
When you unlock this door, exile up to three other target creatures from the battlefield and/or creature cards from graveyards.
When this Room leaves the battlefield, return the exiled cards to their owners' hands.
//
Where Truth Reveals {6}{R}{R}
You may cast cards exiled with permanents you control, and you may spend any type of mana to cast them.
(You may cast either half. That door unlocks on the battlefield. As a sorcery, you may pay the mana cost of a locked door to unlock it.)
